Step 5 — Push changes
git push
Now GitHub will show scripts (lowercase) and the old Scripts folder will disappear.

🔹 Why this works
Git tracks folder contents via file paths.

On macOS, renaming Scripts → scripts alone is ignored because the filesystem is case-insensitive.

Using a temporary name forces Git to register a real move, then renaming to lowercase works.

